{"asset_key":"ep6/gameplay_story_16601120","episode":"ep6","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"16601120","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"narration:0:1660112001:0":{"text":"조아, 후긴, 다미안의 도움으로 봄바람 마켓은 순조롭게 확장되었다","source_cn":"在祖娅、呼金和达米安的帮助下，春鲜集市的店面顺利扩大","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24270C1D70128F7A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:1:1660112002:0":{"text":"하지만 장식 스타일 문제를 두고 세 사람 사이에 약간의 의견 차이가 생겼다...","source_cn":"然而，在装饰风格的问题上，三人产生了一些分歧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED3C8CDF59C7A41C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1660112003:0":{"text":"...기계! 기계라고. 알겠어? 기계야말로 가장 정교한 예술이지!","source_cn":"——机械！你明白吗？机械才是最精湛的艺术！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4FE02212AEAD032","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1660112004:0":{"text":"이건 후긴의 편을 들 수밖에 없겠는걸. 다미안 꼬맹이, 다음에 기회가 되면 내 기계 강아지를 보여줄게. 그건 기계 기술의 정점이라고!","source_cn":"这一点呼金说的没错。小达米安，等下次有机会，我一定要带...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E12F86334619FFB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1660112005:0":{"text":"아... 안 돼요! 봄바람 마켓의 벽을 기어로 가득 채울 순 없잖아요!","source_cn":"不……不行！春鲜集市的墙上不能布满齿轮！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60A9D4C500971F20","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1660112006:1":{"text":"으, 그리고 돌벽이나 철판 같은 것도... 안 돼요! 이건 아발론이랑 전혀 안 어울려요!","source_cn":"呃，还有石砖、铁皮之类的……都不行！这一点都不符合阿瓦...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC652BD1E5B34F7D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1660112007:1":{"text":"최고의 장식은 전부 자연에서 나와요. 나무의 결, 꽃잎의 무늬... 이런 것들을 있는 그대로 보존해야죠!","source_cn":"要我说的话，最好的装饰都都来源于大自然。木头的纹理，花...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x062DC50368002B26","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1660112008:1":{"text":"그건 와일더스 스타일이잖냐. 봄바람 마켓이랑은 안 어울려!","source_cn":"嚯，你这是典型的绿裔风格，和春鲜集市也不搭配！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xECD633317380FB36","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1660112009:1":{"text":"다미안, 나무나 꽃을 좋아한다면 기계와 돌벽 표면에 비슷한 무기를 새길 수 있어. 그러면 네 요구사항도 만족시킬 수 있고, 더 튼튼해. 어때?","source_cn":"达米安老师，你要是实在喜欢树木花草的话，我们其实可以在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x15810FA9A06F38A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1660112010:1":{"text":"하지만 돌이랑 철판의 질감은 바꾸기 어렵잖아요. 이러면 마켓이 아니라 병영처럼 보일 거라고요!","source_cn":"但是石头和铁皮的质感很难改变，这只会让集市看起来像一个兵营！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F6BCB46327ABF97","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1660112011:1":{"text":"병영이 뭐 어때서? 드워프의 병영이라면 세상에서 제일 아름다울 텐데!","source_cn":"兵营怎么了？矮人的兵营肯定是天底下最漂亮——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD73FD0041C1E4C24","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1660112012:0":{"text":"...와! 친구들, 여기서 시끌벅적하게 뭐 하고 있는 거예요?","source_cn":"——嘿！朋友们！你们在热火朝天地聊什么呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E179B2DB070D4AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"블랙 스크린 자막","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:呼金":{"text":"후긴","source":"呼金","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:祖娅":{"text":"조아","source":"祖娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:达米安":{"text":"다미안","source":"达米安","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:热情的声音":{"text":"열정적인 목소리","source":"热情的声音","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":13,"localized_text_count":12,"speaker_count":5}}